OL,3,GNEWSACity 'eyesores' could become      
OL,4,Ahundreds of new homes                  
OL,6,FKingsholm and Wotton councillor Jeremy 
OL,7,FHilton said repurposing Gloucester's   
OL,8,Fredundant sites and buildings in       
OL,9,Fdisrepair was vital for the city's     
OL,10,Ffuture development. All sites will need
OL,11,Fto get planning permission before      
OL,12,Fdevelopment can take place.            
